You feel spoiled.

There is no down staircase on the castle level (I've never
found one).  Within the castle are trapdoors along a narrow
corridor that take you to the next level (the Valley of the
Dead).  Check out the castle first though because there is
always a wand of wishing hidden there as well as food,
weapon, and armor rooms.

When you come up from below you are just placed behind the back
of the castle without a staircase.

